ew Added a separate announcer voice setting. Added a Compact HUD option in Settings. Added first-encounter enemy tips and detailed bestiary stats. Improved Tempter offers and explanations of their consequences. Improved attack warnings, danger zones and vortex behavior. Armor damage is now shown separately from a true block. Fixed dialogue and reward issues. Optimized combat sound loading. Thank you for playing and sharing your feedback!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T00:25:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038392","verified_at":"2026-10-24T05:24:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4303930-1846651706696668","game_id":"steam-4303930","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 0.82 — Vow-Widow / Will of Steel","summary":"Demo 0.82 is now available on Windows and macOS. Here are two highlights. Vow-Widow A new elite enemy has arrived in Arena 1. The Vow-Widow binds a Husk with her Wedding Vow, turning it into a larger, faster and tougher protector that hits harder. Take down the Widow to break the bond. Will of Steel Ashen Blade gains Will of Steel, a defensive passive with a regenerating shield. It absorbs blockable damage before health and recharges after you avoid hits for a while. The current demo is free on ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T20:25:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696668","verified_at":"2026-10-21T04:21:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4303930-1846651706683716","game_id":"steam-4303930","kind":"announcement","title":"Ashen Swarm demo is now available on Mac","summary":"The Ashen Swarm demo is now available on macOS through Steam. Download the free demo and join the fight: Play the demo If you run into a problem on Mac, please let us know in the Steam discussions. Include your Mac model and macOS version so we can investigate. Thank you for playing and helping us improve Ashen Swarm!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T03:18:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683716","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4303930-1846651706679997","game_id":"steam-4303930","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.80 — Big Balance Patch & No Mercy","summary":"The Windows demo has a big balance update. Build around a new universal perk, revisit familiar abilities and face a different mix of enemies in the later waves. New perk: No Mercy Available to both heroes, No Mercy grants 20/40/60 percentage points of critical-hit chance against enemies with an active negative effect. Burn, slow or freeze a target to create an opening. Multiple effects grant one bonus; total critical chance is capped at 100%. Balance highlights Ashenblade: 17 base damage and a 0","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T04:01:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679997","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4303930-1846651706675335","game_id":"steam-4303930","kind":"update","title":"Demo Language Update: 8 New Languages + 0.79.8 Fixes","summary":"The Windows demo now supports 15 interface and subtitle languages. Version 0.79.8 is live! Eight new languages Italian Japanese Korean Polish Turkish Ukrainian Traditional Chinese Spanish — Latin America These join English, Russian, French, German, Spanish — Spain, Portuguese — Brazil and Simplified Chinese. Choose your language in Settings. Voice acting is in English. Changes since 0.78.5 Controller and touch: improved Oathstone navigation and menu focus handling when switching between touch an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T18:51:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675335","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4303930-1846018067942576","game_id":"steam-4303930","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 0.78 — Corruption, the Collegium and a clearer Codex","summary":"Demo 0.78 is now available on Windows. The macOS demo remains on version 0.77 for now. In 0.78, Unbound abilities grow with Corruption, and the Collegium responds with more dangerous moves at higher tiers. We have also updated the Codex, tooltips and enemy movement around obstacles. This post covers every change since 0.76.5, including the fixes already released in 0.77. Update highlights Corruption abilities unlock in stages: Threadweaver gains a strike at T2 and healing at T3. Ashen Blade gain","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T00:43:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942576","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4303930-1846018067935297","game_id":"steam-4303930","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 0.76.5 — The Court, clearer upgrades and progression","summary":"Demo 0.76.5 is now available on Windows and macOS. A reworked Court battle, clearer upgrade cards, a new way to inspect the Effigy, and fixes based on your feedback. Here is what has changed since 0.75. The Court and your run results Reworked the arrival of the Court. The previous enemies and encounters are cleared, and the full Court takes its places before the Foreman's introduction. The transition waits for active conversations and reward choices to finish, so it does not interrupt your decis","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T03:35:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935297","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4303930-1845383656397261","game_id":"steam-4303930","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.75 — Corruption, combat effects and clearer choices","summary":"Thank you for the gameplay clips and detailed feedback. Version 0.75 is now available, bringing together the changes made since our last news post about version 0.72. Corruption and combat The Threadweaver’s Corruption ability now ends its pull with a damaging strike and returns part of the health taken from enemies. Its new violet threads make the capture, final strike and return of health easier to follow. Both Threadweaver casts have been slowed to 1.56 seconds. Forge of Wrath has a new fire ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T18:03:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397261","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4303930-1845383656390043","game_id":"steam-4303930","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 0.72 is live — improvements since Serbian Games Week","summary":"The Windows demo of Ashen Swarm is now on version 0.72. Thank you to everyone who played during Serbian Games Week, shared a gameplay video or told us where a run became confusing. Watching your runs has helped us see which parts of the game needed a clearer explanation. If you last played the festival demo, here are some of the changes made since then. A clearer introduction to the Court The first activated Collegium figure now brings up a short explanation of what the figures mean and how your","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T21:48:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390043","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4303930-1844115010502643","game_id":"steam-4303930","kind":"announcement","title":"Ashen Swarm’s free demo is live — Serbian Games Week","summary":"Ashen Swarm is a dark-fantasy bullet-heaven roguelite. Mix powers from Wrath, Pride and Gluttony to build your arsenal and tear through hordes of the condemned. Choose whom to save or betray, and face the consequences in later runs. Try the free demo during Serbian Games Week, September 21–28. Play the free demo on Steam Enjoyed the run? Add Ashen Swarm to your wishlist for the full release.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T22:32:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010502643","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4303930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:05Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:05Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4303930":"2026-10-26T02:10:05Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4303930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5200600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4303930","app_id":4303930,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:33Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_siz